1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,085
Look! A big goal net and running shoes!

2
00:00:03,485 --> 00:00:05,432
Which sport is it? Can you guess?

3
00:00:09,232 --> 00:00:11,520
Yes! It's football! Kick, kick, goal!

4
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,569
Say it with me! Football!

5
00:00:16,869 --> 00:00:18,911
Look! Goggles and lots of water!

6
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:20,414
Which sport is it?

7
00:00:24,214 --> 00:00:26,396
Yes! It's swimming! Splash, splash!

8
00:00:26,896 --> 00:00:28,428
Say it with me! Swimming!

9
00:00:31,728 --> 00:00:33,998
Look! A helmet and a long, long road!

10
00:00:34,398 --> 00:00:35,501
Which sport is it?

11
00:00:39,301 --> 00:00:41,412
Yes! It's cycling! Pedal, pedal!

12
00:00:41,912 --> 00:00:43,576
Say it with me! Cycling!

13
00:00:46,876 --> 00:00:49,084
Look! Cold snow on a tall mountain!

14
00:00:49,484 --> 00:00:51,157
Last one! Which sport is it?

15
00:00:54,957 --> 00:00:56,518
Yes! It's skiing! Whoosh!

16
00:00:57,018 --> 00:00:58,551
Say it with me! Skiing!

17
00:01:01,551 --> 00:01:04,414
Wow! You got them all! Which sport do you like best?

